{"time": 1767940490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "722146980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么感觉在立flag）"}
{"time": 1767941016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265681647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=917477545]你才注意到，日记本封面左侧、靠近书脊的部分，多了一处塔样图案，顶端则没入烟云中。稍微靠近中间一点的部位，也多了一小片建筑的图案，和学院颇有几分相像。书页内的内容倒是还没有增添别的人形，但在最开头莫名多加了一页，上面是你自己的画像"}
{"time": 1767941221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318731394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"感觉颇有些新奇，仔细看一看自己的画像，一边接过话，\"在学院的话，应该也不会有什么变故吧？\""}
{"time": 1767941242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479808072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好多flag）"}
{"time": 1767941669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639083513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...只要好好学习的话，应该不会有什么事吧”"}
{"time": 1767941786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804474700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛。”合上日记，“这几天是难得的闲暇日子，好好享受一番咯，之后就会很忙了。”站起身，伸个懒腰，回房间休息"}
{"time": 1767941970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855016340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等大家都吃完，帮忙收拾一下，也回房间休息了"}
{"time": 1767942326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945993033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(公瑾在旁，智定天下)"}
{"time": 1767942404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439637519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，接下来的几天悠闲到有些漫长。城市里也发生着微妙的变化，比如摩伽陀的数量越来越多，尤其是在冒险家协会发布第一弹天空之塔调查报告后。工艺品原料和成品的价格下降，但订单数量则是暴涨，以至于汉斯着家的时间都短了。"}
{"time": 1767942553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126297729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "校徽倒是第三天就送到了你们手中，而预订的开学日期则是第五天"}
{"time": 1767942577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509950560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，有校服吗)"}
{"time": 1767942600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332272961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（应该是有但不要求）"}
{"time": 1767942657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734439707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我要穿之前那套了，最经典款式)"}
{"time": 1767942839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34434478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "和校徽一起送到的还有分班、宿舍信息和课程安排。一年级的课程安排得不多不少，一周20节，就上三下三晚一的时间表来说，等效三天满课"}
{"time": 1767942928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799799176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一眼自己的分班和宿舍安排"}
{"time": 1767942974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144712761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看眼分班，和舒茉一个班，和舒茉一个班，心里这样不断祈祷着"}
{"time": 1767943002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666791609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥过个幸运吧）"}
{"time": 1767943011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589789450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
