{"time": 1768014389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547039249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(要是好接的话也不会内向了)"}
{"time": 1768014405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517793602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "梅琳娜给你们让开了进门的路，站回自己的座位旁。莫奈接过话头“不信，这儿是魔法学院诶。好啦好啦不管那个了，先选床位吧？”"}
{"time": 1768014439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243010818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "梅琳娜和莫奈的床位占了宿舍的对角，不管怎么选都要被两人包围就是了"}
{"time": 1768014559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865348661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=54639594]听起来室内同样已经有人先登了"}
