{"time": 1768033088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250267530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1810788500]下意识就向母亲求助了，但是...希望母亲能帮自己社交什么的...深呼吸，移开自己的视线，握着手。"}
{"time": 1768035484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655816359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1798995964]门外是个看起来有些土气，和你气质有几分相似的男生，一看就是新生"}
{"time": 1768035582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693189815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看他身上有没有行李"}
