{"time": 1768389187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580256999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只有校园这种，天天见面但是又都有自己生活的地方）"}
{"time": 1768389202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756952477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（才有那种时时惦念的悸动啊）"}
{"time": 1768389249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586653228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "站在一旁，在想要不去劝劝舒茉也加进来吧...emmm，但舒茉说不定已经很忙了..而且她也不一定喜欢这种事，要不去问问她吧，她之前好像走的时候提到过烹饪和舞蹈来着"}
{"time": 1768389308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306807865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不好说，但是加入协会肯定是一件不急的事）"}
{"time": 1768389318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029449709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不急吗）"}
{"time": 1768389332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887944789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还以为错过这个机会就得等下次百团大会了（）"}
{"time": 1768389336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306537477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不会跑了，而且协会本来就和学院绑定）"}
{"time": 1768389340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584799407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(分享自己加入这件事，如果就在附近也可以找找吧。)"}
{"time": 1768389353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611541247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(当然应该不是很急，应该这几天都可以。)"}
{"time": 1768389365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381893650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那两个摊位离得近吗，看一看"}
{"time": 1768389392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702787970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（协会又不是什么校招。本来就是长期开放的社会组织啊）"}
{"time": 1768389626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820611076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=381893650]不近.jpg。而且你兄弟正在测试"}
{"time": 1768389691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769543488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "离得远的话只能作罢了...明天见面的时候说吧，反正协会也跑不掉，不过心里还是有点失落，要是能第一时间和她分享就好了"}
{"time": 1768389718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658376582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=623938411]“I won't.”她回答得简单，莫奈也终于转了回来，扇动空气中的香气用力闻着“嗯嗯，好香！不错嘛”"}
{"time": 1768389820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497506220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=658376582]\"学长教得好，梅琳娜的火候控制得也很好啦，而且这个也很简单...\"彻底放松下来，四处打量一下，询问学长，\"请问有保温的盒子吗...\""}
{"time": 1768390027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133427938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果几位打算入社的话，烹饪社有餐厨用具套组，里面包含金属餐盒、一把厨刀和锅碗之类。40银一套，比杂货店里的便宜哦”"}
{"time": 1768390070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247439433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"直接点头，完全不带犹豫，\"我入社...\""}
{"time": 1768390072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014071426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=820611076]柯林斯同样注入魔力，看起来液面分界线比你的略高一些"}
{"time": 1768390226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807298534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好厉害，自己得多向柯林斯学习啊"}
{"time": 1768390260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764563027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“见习高段，学弟真是天赋异禀”那人笑笑，同样递出表与徽章，看上去和你手里的没什么区别"}
{"time": 1768390367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850140335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“深藏不漏啊”等柯林斯回来拍拍他肩膀“亚克也快去吧”"}
{"time": 1768390508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537876973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1247439433]“啊啊，我也……”莫奈也挤了过来，很快学长给你们递来两个小箱子，笑道“有两位新生校花候选人一起加入，真是值得庆祝。”"}
{"time": 1768390511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990746769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当浮一大白）"}
{"time": 1768390668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421087673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1537876973]\"没有啦...\"有些不好意思地低下头，打开小箱子，拿出里面的饭盒看看干不干净，\"嗯...莫奈待会要好好尝一尝...犒劳，算是吧？\""}
{"time": 1768390751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616821808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=850140335]“不是我藏，这不是没有漏的机会？”他耸肩“目标是学生会主席的话，当然要样样都优秀”"}
{"time": 1768390822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172007522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "亚克紧随其后地摸上水晶球，水平和你比起来稍低，但是也是中段。看来你离高段也就是一步之遥"}
{"time": 1768390901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322485371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=616821808]“那我得提前巴结巴结领导了”笑着说到"}
{"time": 1768390961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858468459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1421087673]材质大概是某种轻金属，干净无异味，就是不知道到底保不保温。"}
