{"time": 1768448120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098079744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好吧，tes,不是哥哥）"}
{"time": 1768460523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687713290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=477585241]“我已经心满意足了啦。”莫奈单手叉腰“两家社团已经够我忙的了。跟着你走咯”\n梅琳娜微微颔首表态，没有开口"}
{"time": 1768460670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245996505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "来的时候两手空空，现在倒是多了一个小箱子，拎起来，\"那我带路吧...\"一边往文学社走，一边仔细看看人群，如果能找到伊恩的话..."}
{"time": 1768460757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349240346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那，你过个幸运？）"}
{"time": 1768460981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397053706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1835212695]你费了点劲才把手伸过人堆，尽管已经被许多人摸过，狐妖的毛发依旧柔顺亮丽，且温暖。而且与寻常动物不同，体内实打实地有着魔力"}
{"time": 1768461140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252770121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1768461194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956572116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "毛茸茸的生物摸起来就是舒服...要不养一只，算了算了，现在连自己都养不活..."}
{"time": 1768461401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633457042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20 luck"}
{"time": 1768461401, "type": "reply", "message_id": "633457042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]使用[luck]演奏出:[1D20=1]"}
{"time": 1768461414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959532024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(lucky～)"}
{"time": 1768461415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450019199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（wow，还有大失败）"}
{"time": 1768461438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363185045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概，确实。旁边的立牌上写了领养须知，其中就包括饲料要求天然包含魔力。不过，不需要饲养的魔宠也是有的，多半是元素灵体、或者依靠契约召唤。对一年级生来说，大概比钱更成问题"}
{"time": 1768461493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440799804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要不把饭摔了吧.jpg）"}
{"time": 1768461612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978833807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎大失败）"}
{"time": 1768461785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90485148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头，还是收起养宠物的心吧，继续揉揉，听着狐狸舒服的声音，感觉心情稍微好了些"}
{"time": 1768462291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807351304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1245996505]你找得专心，不过完全没能找到伊恩或者他舍友的身影。不过，路过魔宠区的时候，你莫名感觉你的脚好像被什么扯了一下"}
{"time": 1768462687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824054638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...?\"停下脚步，低头看看"}
{"time": 1768463524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081383716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1824054638]一根触须不知道什么时候搭上你的鞋面，大体潮湿，沾着些尘土。触须的主人是一只拖着脑袋和其他蠕动的触须的章鱼。它来的方向，一个玻璃罐被扭开了口，而它正孜孜不倦地朝着它选中的方向爬。搭上你鞋袜的部分开始变成死去珊瑚般的白色，只有那对方条眼依旧不变"}
{"time": 1768463871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540448160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呀!\"黏腻的触感透过鞋袜传到脚踝，被吓得大声尖叫，大脑一片空白，一时不知道要做什么"}
{"time": 1768463907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864779832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 过一个听）"}
{"time": 1768463925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068741597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
{"time": 1768463925, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1068741597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]演奏出: 1D20=20"}
{"time": 1768463931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893461074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（无敌了）"}
{"time": 1768463935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787813937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那很厉害了）"}
{"time": 1768464060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636965481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "莫奈被你本人吓了一跳，视线下移之后变成惊呼的第二跳。梅琳娜的手中已经点起火焰，差点就要抛出"}
{"time": 1768464124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988713957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "另一边，十余米外，亚克已经被猫猫狗狗包围，而你听见很熟悉的声音"}
{"time": 1768464244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527992963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "本来还在想着舒茉在就好了，结果耳边就传来了尖叫，无比确信是舒茉的声音，急忙起身，朝声音的方向跑去，果然看到了舒茉...但同时也看见一只章鱼好像抓住了舒茉，顾不得多想，下意识的手里凝出冰刃，朝触手砍去"}
{"time": 1768464345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908161556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（章鱼大概，从头到脚30cm吧，展开之后从一段到另一端大概50cm）"}
{"time": 1768464431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547457703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还不小）"}
{"time": 1768464445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74607028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也不算大吧）"}
