{"time": 1768476050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047329967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2014576888]柯林斯和亚克站在你背后隔了几米的地方，亚克一身各色毛发，在黑衣服上尤为明显。柯林斯好些，只有袖口沾上了。"}
{"time": 1768476078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316637939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至于夏洛克，他蹲在那个黑漆漆的玻璃罐跟前，不知道在弄什么"}
{"time": 1768476097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935737181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么样了...”想到他们刚刚可能都看到了，尴尬的咳嗽几下"}
{"time": 1768476317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119736454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么怎么样了？”柯林斯有些玩味地开口“动作挺快嘛，就是下次别用那么危险的办法了。”"}
{"time": 1768476358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109410799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(提醒一下，你手里还拎着盒子，jpg)"}
{"time": 1768476372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287010453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不影响啊(）"}
{"time": 1768476431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038449730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有点太急了么....下次会注意的，哈哈”尴尬的笑笑“对了，亚克的入会怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1768476521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476558761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还没呢……我都快忘了”他挠挠头，回去问工作人员了"}
{"time": 1768477181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681844719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你在看什么”靠近夏洛克好奇的问问"}
{"time": 1768477482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415826677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=733489128]“嗯……嗯？我们宿舍要养一只吗？”她来了点兴致“毛茸茸可以，舒茉喜欢什么？”"}
{"time": 1768477575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508883176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=681844719]“哼……”夏洛克轻轻扭了一下玻璃罐的盖子，里面的东西很快又把盖子拧了回位“很聪明的小家伙。”"}
{"time": 1768477678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300705790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶....你不会要收养它吧..”"}
{"time": 1768477795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841783359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“why not，我本身就亲和水元素魔力”他拎起罐子站起来，找到刚才那个社员“同学，可以申请领养这家伙吗？”"}
{"time": 1768477923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871618669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这....”自己也不知道该怎么说"}
{"time": 1768478023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707611491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1415826677]\"唔...猫猫狗狗，兔子，小狐狸?\"一边报着名字，一边思考着，\"我其实没什么意见啦，只要不咬我...\""}
{"time": 1768478169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561023933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "希望这章鱼不要以后咬自己"}
{"time": 1768478308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621677604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1871618669]“这…”对方的反应和你大差不差，不过惊讶中还带着些许期待“同学刚刚也看见了，这小家伙有些……”\n“那不影响，我也承诺不会因为那种‘前科’而不尽责”他把罐子单手举着，并不在意手指被外壁的墨汁染黑"}
