{"time": 1768882268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897928000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(俺寻思)"}
{"time": 1768882383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243633941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "先前你没有仔细思考过元素相关的问题，自然也没有观察过别的元素。在这房间中，冰元素更是少的可怜，分辨不出来"}
{"time": 1768882399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498292362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（终结之地了）"}
{"time": 1768882620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754795755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"这个问题之后去问伊恩就好了，索性也不纠结太多，\"梅琳娜有什么转化火元素和光元素的技巧吗？\"心里想着魔力亲和之类的东西，同时开足马力转化火元素的魔力"}
{"time": 1768883150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651663051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=708263142]你们踏上了归途。天已经擦黑，不过看起来西海岸的夜生活比赫顿玛尔丰富得多。街道被人造光源照得透亮，看趋势直到12点都还会有店开门"}
{"time": 1768883403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771109479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1754795755]“没有说得上技巧的东西。”梅琳娜摇头“这是我唯一的天赋，所以练得多些”"}
{"time": 1768883886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102534394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1771109479]\"好吧，看来只需要练习就够了?\""}
