{"time": 1769053385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045110029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（这套装是人类吗）"}
{"time": 1769053462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997806203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=62892614]“诶嘿？伊恩是我的人嘛。”轻轻靠在伊恩怀里，“所以~我要是做了会长，你就当我的书记吧~？小说里都是这样啦。”"}
{"time": 1769053488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96665342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（天才的）"}
{"time": 1769053497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673585946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（恋爱头脑战？）"}
{"time": 1769053520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044920296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行啊...不过当副会长好像也可以吧”畅想未来"}
{"time": 1769053622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459055250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛，得先要当上才行啦。”稍微有些不自信，“那么多厉害的人...我的话...好难哦...”"}
{"time": 1769053654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853276821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉也不弱啊，看起来很有亲和力呢”"}
{"time": 1769053735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897233323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（元素亲和力也是亲和力（）"}
{"time": 1769053894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137869124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“亲和力...?”低下脑袋仰视伊恩，不过相应的，靠得更近了一些，“哪有啦...我不是什么很受欢迎...大家都会喜欢的对象吧。”说完干脆把脑袋靠到伊恩的脖间，吐出温热的呼吸，“只有伊恩这么觉得...”"}
{"time": 1769053941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497819743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉看起来很受欢迎吧..放心吧，我也在舒茉身边，遇到什么问题我们一起承担好了”"}
{"time": 1769054082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821735037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那伊恩的室友那边？只能多多抱歉咯？”咯咯笑了出来，话锋一转，“嗯...因为不擅长，所以才想着——有这种机会...就得试试啦。”"}
{"time": 1769054238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847754001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“公平竞争，有什么抱歉不抱歉的...会成功的..不过舒茉也不要给自己太大压力了,要不反而得不偿失了”"}
{"time": 1769054386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396746576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1847754001]“既然决定了要参加，肯定要全力以赴啦。”轻轻掐掐伊恩的脸，“而且，肯定要抱歉嘛，伊恩的室友少了伊恩的话，赢不了我。”点点头"}
{"time": 1769054642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644818224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(赶紧该敲铃了？"}
{"time": 1769054651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278706169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我哪有那么厉害...”有点不好意思，不只是言语，还有行为“好犯规啊，舒茉这样，我都没办法集中心思了”揉揉舒茉的手“舒茉要不先躺好？”"}
{"time": 1769054661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905433440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
