{"time": 1769089053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337485389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=97758228]“窗台上看得一清二楚嘛，嘻嘻，那叫一个如胶似漆如影随形……”她奸笑着靠近列娜，随后好像要场景重现一般搓起狐狸脑袋"}
{"time": 1769089204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347838813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=748055819]“希望我不用提醒你。”她看起来似乎不太高兴，但是她一直看起来都不太高兴“勤做。这方法对我来说很重要。”"}
{"time": 1769089243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138345457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的好的，对不起，教授...”有点抱歉“还有什么事吗教授”"}
{"time": 1769089372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922234796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=337485389]\"诶?一清二楚?哈?\"跑到窗台仔细看看"}
{"time": 1769089424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151285342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2138345457]她表情似乎舒缓了一些“我不太放心，过来点。”"}
{"time": 1769089456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025267725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "乖乖靠近，教授肯定不会害自己的"}
{"time": 1769089459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735585297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=922234796]显然说的不是看见那片小树林。不过楼下门口那段路可是能看得一清二楚"}
{"time": 1769089636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910933052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（到家了吗）[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1769089673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868334924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶....\"鼓了鼓脸颊，尽管瞬间脸上红了一片，低下头有些不好意思地开口，\"他...怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1769089694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061005672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1025267725]米拉从袖口取出一根纤细的魔杖，点在你的胸口。似乎有一缕魔力钻入你的心口，你不确定“this will remind you.”"}
{"time": 1769089715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932737926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=910933052]（刚刚）"}
{"time": 1769089745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122032105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢教授...”应该是提醒自己加固和压缩用的吧"}
{"time": 1769089879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363660142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（上号）"}
{"time": 1769089950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018454039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=868334924]“嗯……”莫奈眨眨眼“真的要我评价？嗯嗯，外貌说得过去啦，但是总感觉，唔……更高点就好了？”"}
{"time": 1769090044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165329390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2018454039]\"嗯...\"尽管自己觉得伊恩的样貌已经算是很好了，\"能入莫奈的眼诶?那我就放心了。\"想平息气息，但仍然有些局促，\"嗯...刚刚不会很显眼吧...这里都看见了...\""}
{"time": 1769090207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145321917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2122032105]她似乎读出了你心中所想，摇了摇头。随后收回魔杖，撩开了自己另一边头发“是提醒你别忘了为什么来这。”\n另一边，从未揭开过的长发之下，原本是眼睛的地方只有虚无的空洞，不对，似乎有什么东西在扭动"}
{"time": 1769107194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693561325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？...这是...什么.黑暗之眼？原来教授也有吗...怪不得您那么懂”"}
