{"time": 1769152305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391716789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1165329390](1)"}
{"time": 1769152306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021692205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=854943816]在无人也无充足外部魔力辅助的前提下，效果只能说几乎差强人意"}
{"time": 1769152591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058344201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1165329390]“嘻嘻，不知道多少人这个点还闲着没事干往下面看咯？”莫奈依依不舍地松开列娜。随后穿着不起眼灰麻睡衣的梅琳娜推门进来，像个没事人一样和你打招呼“晚上好。”"}
{"time": 1769152610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688298802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1021692205]（差强人意也可以了）"}
{"time": 1769152633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045465349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（几乎差强人意就是还没有（）"}
{"time": 1769152682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544666171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "满意的睡过去"}
{"time": 1769152754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564860574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2058344201]\"嗯...\"回过身对着梅琳娜点点头，\"晚上好，我去洗漱了。\"拿睡衣去洗漱"}
{"time": 1769153011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739379340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拍了拍自己的脸颊，心中暗自想到希望不要成为明天的欣慰就好。"}
{"time": 1769153016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025214938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(新闻)"}
{"time": 1769153206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "928204748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1544666171]今天发生的事情说少不少，但是对你而言，不过是许多波澜壮阔的日子之一。你没过多久就睡了过去，一闭眼就把自己梦进那片你唯一熟悉的海里"}
{"time": 1769153249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836971873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "唔...好经典的梦，感受一下这里魔力的浓郁程度"}
{"time": 1769153362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785492046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=739379340]谁知道呢.jpg。不过往好处想，如果真的人尽皆知，至少来骚扰你的男生会变少"}
{"time": 1769153508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555498874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "甩甩脑袋，不想关注这件事，\"好累。\"去这边的浴室看看"}
{"time": 1769153526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876784206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=836971873]（什么叫梦里的魔力浓郁程度（）"}
{"time": 1769153549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936337228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（万一这其实是什么修炼圣地呢（）"}
{"time": 1769153557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708669240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（也很典吧）"}
{"time": 1769153571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086582914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（典在哪）"}
{"time": 1769153592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548535677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又吸不到你身体里）"}
{"time": 1769153635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480494336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果你想悟点什么，那也和魔力浓度没关系吧（）"}
{"time": 1769153864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106606836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1555498874]联排的木质隔间，有固定的花洒。有一处魔力输入装置，直连向水箱，输入任意种类的魔力都可以转化为能量加热洗澡水。某种程度上也算一种日常训练"}
{"time": 1769153870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182913165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=548535677]（试试么）"}
{"time": 1769153946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943813728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=106606836]灌输自己的魔力，脱好衣服，洗一个舒服的热水澡"}
{"time": 1769154232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256623689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "换好睡衣，虽然今天不想洗衣服，但是...摇摇头，坚持现在就去把换下的衣服洗好。"}
{"time": 1769154260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761536934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=836971873]这里当然没有可以被称为“魔力”的东西，尽管你可以在这里施展你的那些魔法。你在水里沉浮着，不知为何今天的水体触感尤其……真切，舔舐着你的每一寸肌肤。不冷，但包裹感尤为明显"}
{"time": 1769154295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632252399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉怪怪的，不过自己也做不到什么，只能随波逐流了"}
{"time": 1769154538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010969697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=256623689]等你忙完这些，整条楼道就几乎不剩几点光亮了"}
{"time": 1769154590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065327996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1010969697]着睡衣，抱着自己洗好的衣服回去，在门口看看灯有没有熄，小心翼翼地推门进去，尽量不发出什么声响。"}
{"time": 1769155071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828725552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1632252399]不知何处，波涛卷涌。机械的白噪声传入你耳中，你突然能理解那簇浪的想法，那是梦与血的语言，它在说着——“家”。那簇浪呼唤着家，当你听得懂第一阵涛声，便好似醍醐灌顶一般，你听懂了……茫茫一片无边的血海，每一处浪都在呼唤着“家”。重叠无序，组成比海更庞大的声浪"}
{"time": 1769155172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807574004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2065327996]自然还留着，不过底下已经没有人，看起来莫奈和梅琳娜都已经上了床，列娜也是。"}
{"time": 1769155377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350812543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1807574004]把自己的衣服晾好，上床休息，今天的自己格外有些大胆，不知道是不是陌生环境的原因。"}
{"time": 1769155495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132302989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有没有宿舍夜间闲聊环节）"}
{"time": 1769155564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "903925399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那肯定是莫奈起头)"}
{"time": 1769156190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804871912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好冷）"}
{"time": 1769156320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004300960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是好冷)"}
{"time": 1769156807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715039396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=763081188]（你还记得这个吗）"}
{"time": 1769156872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787948122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有的，但是她要提一下，嗯哼?)"}
{"time": 1769156877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651813964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我主动提吗)"}
{"time": 1769157015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885282129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那她现在也不失眠，应该不怎么会提）"}
{"time": 1769157046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914202501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=350812543]\"说起来...\"轻声开口，\"莫奈需要我帮忙做个好梦吗？\""}
{"time": 1769157154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991371802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1828725552][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “家....家？”不太懂它是什么意思“就算你这样说...我也什么都想不起来”"}
{"time": 1769157391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547278969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1914202501]“嗯……？哦哦”莫奈那头传来她的声音，刚吸过狐狸的她此时声音里还带着些微雀跃“那，我就来体验体验啦”"}
{"time": 1769157521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953294178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1547278969]\"嗯哼?\"从床上坐起来，挪到莫奈那一侧，\"那，莫奈做好准备，不要抵抗哦?\""}
{"time": 1769157896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648156511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=991371802]每一片浪都不一样，有的在呜咽，有的在哭嚎。如果它们还活着，恐怕会比这片血海更壮观。不过现在，它们有机会死第二次了\n巨大的腕足携着末端的音爆，从天空抽落，暴戾而蛮不讲理地将海水分开、抽碎。血水在巨大的轰鸣中逆飞上天，随后雨水淅沥落下，海洋沉寂下来，不再喧嚣"}
{"time": 1769158107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627503661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1953294178]“嗯嗯，不会睡死过去吧？”她半开玩笑地问“明天早上要记得叫我哦”"}
{"time": 1769158140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237471454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”有点不太理解发生了什么，感觉最近的梦境越来越狂野了"}
{"time": 1769158175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584835519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（确实比较意识流）"}
{"time": 1769158191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917543387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你的rp能不能不要只发一个问号（）"}
{"time": 1769158222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517867846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就没有一点别的反应吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1769158242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725313327", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，反正好像也没影响到自己，呆呆的等待梦境结束吧，应该是这样吧....."}
{"time": 1769158267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587662419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是太淡定了）"}
