{"time": 1769755492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742094619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=746740146][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 去摇一下夏洛克"}
{"time": 1769755514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370066015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“夏洛克，差不多该起床了”"}
{"time": 1769755586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422935983", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……嗯？”床上的人猛打哈欠，被子蠕动了一番“几点了？”"}
{"time": 1769755597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161611892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1003225100]“嗯……嗯？”床上的人猛打哈欠，被子蠕动了一番“几点了？”"}
{"time": 1769755622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964002794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好熟悉的话)"}
{"time": 1769755630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193145805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像上演了无数遍)"}
{"time": 1769755697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759298349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"九点半啦，开学典礼要开始了。\"赶忙大声地开口，可不能让她再睡过去。"}
{"time": 1769755750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113781062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=370066015]“干嘛？”过了一小会，他穿着睡衣把脑袋探出床沿，看起来有点睁不开眼"}
{"time": 1769755779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737693992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“九点半啦，等下还有开学典礼呢”"}
{"time": 1769756217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571912675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1759298349]“啊啊，还有开学典礼……”她好像清醒了些，至少坐起来了，头发蓬蓬的，看起来像炸了毛“睡得好爽……”"}
{"time": 1769756404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276672131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1737693992]“好浪费时间的东西。”他眼睛眯得几乎要合上“花一个小时听成功学演讲？”"}
{"time": 1769756429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764744023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那也不能不去吧...点名记过就不好了”"}
{"time": 1769756482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788800370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（格兰芬多-20？）"}
{"time": 1769756584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879542289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么样?有做一个好梦吗？\"坐在床上，腿上还卷着被子，想来自己的头发打理也需要一会，既然她醒了，自己就下床开始打理好了。"}
{"time": 1769756946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597400072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=764744023]（我在想，记过有什么用）"}
{"time": 1769756958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809465961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他甚至不需要毕业证（））"}
{"time": 1769756992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572960780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有点困）"}
{"time": 1769757053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493569825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=764744023]“啊，好无趣的事”他摇摇头，不过还是下了床“学校里就没什么有意思的事情吗？”"}
{"time": 1769757191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123602430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1572960780](不批)"}
{"time": 1769757214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414888314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=879542289]“嗯……有吗？记不清了”莫奈晚了些才下床，去到自己的位置上梳理，疑似有点赶“这一觉好像睡了好几十年”"}
{"time": 1769757430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821915868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，如果真睡那么久反而不会舒服啦。\"把翘起来的头发压平，更多的就没什么时间打理了，干脆就换一身校服，\"梅琳娜?\"回头看她"}
{"time": 1769757709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961277635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“出发前需要刷一下毛。”梅琳娜没回头，不如说还有点在争分夺秒地翻看着教材。列娜在她腿上眯着眼睛，令人羡慕地趴着"}
{"time": 1769757941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598418977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总感觉有点睡不够，打个哈欠，看了看镜子里的自己，掐掐自己的脸提神，\"好～我洗漱完就准备出发。\"动身去洗漱。"}
{"time": 1769758271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980973343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可以帮我个忙吗？”你出门之前，梅琳娜半转过来，对房间内的你们开口“我不知道怎么抱走它。”"}
{"time": 1769758370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704813188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"走到梅琳娜身边，轻轻拍拍狐狸脑袋，\"列娜听得懂吗？听得懂吧!\"挠挠她的下巴，然后稍微用力拽了拽她的前爪"}
{"time": 1769758944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349714321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "列娜缩了缩脖子，打了个几乎要咧到耳朵的哈欠，这才不情不愿地落到地上"}
{"time": 1769759018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377825422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢。”梅琳娜的视线跟随了一秒列娜，随后对你点点头，开始清理裙摆上沾着的少许狐毛"}
{"time": 1769759092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729261634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没关系啦，梅琳娜只是没有开口。只要说了，她听得懂的。\"一拍手，\"啊，糟了，时间!\"火急火燎地去洗漱。"}
{"time": 1769759840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886128070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "晨间的盥洗室人总是比夜间多的，何况卡点的大有人在。莫奈换完衣服出来一看，果断放弃了精心打扮，回房间扎了个简单的马尾辫"}
{"time": 1769760153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133732534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己也只是做个简单洗漱，用红色的发绳扎一个高一点的马尾，似乎也没有专门要带的东西。倒也不急着先走一步，等着和室友一起出发。"}
{"time": 1769760347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26893587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "梅琳娜，依旧是那副标准三好学生的样子。文静，礼貌，早早地收拾得一丝不苟。手里拿着一副纸笔，看起来已经做好了在开学典礼上写点什么的准备了"}
{"time": 1769760574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762829848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "诶？这种场合有什么值得记录的东西吗？但既然梅琳娜都带着了...这么想着，把自己的日记本和笔收进随身的包里。"}
{"time": 1769761470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932974168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好困）"}
{"time": 1769761637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032434640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=809465961]（可能可以换功法吧（bushi））[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1769761693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739443539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=493569825][CQ:at,qq=825734198] \"说不定比想象中的有点意思...\""}
{"time": 1769761744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558907614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“去了才知道么”回去坐椅子上休息会"}
{"time": 1769762168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500815356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=762829848]“唔唔，好像是10点开始……”莫奈看了看指向9:50的时钟，拉上你们“快点快点，不会只有前排的位子了吧？”"}
{"time": 1769762293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818397623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种坐哪都没差吧...\"小声回她，跟着她小跑起来"}
{"time": 1769762307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754486660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看眼表"}
{"time": 1769762340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164399398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我超，感觉昨天把电脑拆开之后，一直卡卡的（）"}
{"time": 1769762355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741765363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（一顿一顿的的卡，难道是因为我没接电池导致的？）"}
{"time": 1769762513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650970507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1739443539]9:35，还算得上充裕。夏洛克耸肩，慢吞吞地找着校服“绝无可能，这不是概率问题。”"}
{"time": 1769762559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870833083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我的意思是，额，说不定会有其他事件”不过对自己来说开学典礼也就一般了，有意思的是后面会发生的事情"}
{"time": 1769770537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796355157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=870833083]“好像下午社团还在招新，不过该逛的好像都逛得差不多了？”亚克摇了摇头，清醒了些“还有什么？”"}
