{"time": 1769998031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242893526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=796355157]“我的意思是什么突然发生的，计划之外的事情”"}
{"time": 1769998348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140249679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说得好，我决定把我的所有时间拿去碰那些计划之外的事情”夏洛克耸肩“我去图书馆了”"}
{"time": 1769998789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299967448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧”见状也不多说什么了，反正自己本来去开学典礼也不是为了开学典礼去的，看眼表“亚克呢，要去吗”"}
{"time": 1769999033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487862454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……得去的吧”亚克点点头“反正我会带上书，如果典礼比课本还无聊的话……”"}
{"time": 1769999488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451209491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那走吧”带上那个盒子和小册子，出发"}
{"time": 1769999514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500692677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（盒子还在你这啊）"}
