{"time": 1770103866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751436307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，以后再也不先出格温了，选羊混混好了）"}
{"time": 1770103932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858913487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=557250853]按照班级不同，给出了标牌。不过看起来也没严格地按照划分出的区域坐人。离开场还有一小会，一部分盯着入口看的人吹起口哨来"}
{"time": 1770104181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3935407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有看见伊恩...低了低脑袋，不想继续和太多人视线相接，跟在莫奈身后朝着自己的班级走过去，"}
{"time": 1770104277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536661995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "额，怎么还有吹口哨的人，好邪恶，确认一下那些人的脸，以后有机会的话教训他们一下，额，至少也避开就是了，然后眼神在跟随着舒茉，看看她坐在哪，方便结束了自己去找她"}
{"time": 1770104398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597067859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吹口哨邪恶在哪）"}
{"time": 1770104438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162844960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吹口哨有一种轻浮调戏的感觉，而且常见于小混混看到漂亮女生的时候）"}
{"time": 1770104440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396250412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "稍微拽了拽莫奈的袖子，方便自己同步步伐。"}
{"time": 1770104496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719419222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是邪恶在哪）"}
{"time": 1770104551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149131380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（普通的求偶而已.jpg）"}
