{"time": 1770104799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019018114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1396250412]莫奈在前面开路，对骚动视若无睹，来到3班中段找了个联排空位"}
{"time": 1770104913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799799420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "小小的骚动也随着主持人的终于登台而消弭"}
