{"time": 1773219738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206770771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "趴下来咬住她的脖子"}
{"time": 1773219777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105161525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不赖)"}
{"time": 1773219794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134650576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2080164149]等着课程正式开始，自己先翻翻书"}
{"time": 1773219815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489254124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=206770771]她的头颅里几乎没有什么血，但当你咬下去，却感觉到有些莫名的甜美，吸引力十足。"}
{"time": 1773219952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385959543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "？有点想吃，不对不对，在想什么啊，emmm...血差不多了，下来应该就是给血吧..把自己的血输进去"}
{"time": 1773219979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934185404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1134650576]课本上大致是不同魔导器的分类，制作办法，当然第一节课却是，如何判别适合自己的魔导器。也就是所谓的绪论。\n\"这节课的时间我会给每一个学生发一个魔导器。\"她的语气虽然轻，但却一石激起千层浪，教室里顿时压抑不住，沸腾起来。"}
{"time": 1773220061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119468326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1385959543]你感觉脑袋晕乎乎地，那股吸引力非但没有消退，反而更加致命。那是属于，你的主人的血...在这具快要冰冷的身体里，你几乎听见耳边有轻柔的女声低语，\"想要吗?\""}
{"time": 1773220100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508135172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1934185404]“啊？”猛地抬起头来，心跳加速起来“还有这种好事？”"}
{"time": 1773220150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827805491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔导器诶，一个得要不少钱的吧？”"}
{"time": 1773220272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171437246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来，伊布=elf=伊芙=精灵？）"}
{"time": 1773220318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931368680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“........”感觉快要忍不住了，下意识的就想点头了，催动手上的冰霜戒指，让自己稍微冷静一点，感觉应该快差不多了"}
{"time": 1773220462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467791307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=931368680]变故陡生，你身下的头颅动了起来，咬住了你的脖子，你感觉血液从脖颈大量流失，向着身下的残缺身体一股脑涌去。"}
{"time": 1773220516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772112528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？什么鬼，怎么诈尸了”试图挣脱"}
{"time": 1773220576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119570140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1827805491]\"虽然都是我的试做品。\"她的语气极其慵懒，仿佛随时都会睡下去，\"不过这学期结束的时候，成绩拿到优的同学可以获得试做品的真品。\"教室里爆发热烈的讨论，每个人的表情都很兴奋，齐刷刷盯着讲台上的人。"}
{"time": 1773220592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184752116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1171437246](我一直觉得伊芙就是elf啊)"}
{"time": 1773220648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760953908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（elk）"}
{"time": 1773220680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492431104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（主要是伊布吧）"}
{"time": 1773220699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374112068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过正经说伊芙应该是eve）"}
{"time": 1773220738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655406316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(eva"}
{"time": 1773220801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758397907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那是夏娃）"}
{"time": 1773220870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205584249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1772112528]不知何时，她的手已经箍住了你的后背，你被死死压在她的怀里。"}
{"time": 1773220923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638214555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你...你之后可是我的眷属...怎么敢这么对我....停下来...不然...”感觉有点脱力"}
{"time": 1773220965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707481730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1119570140]“嗯嗯……不赖。”不自觉坐正了些，虽然不好说自己会不会在这里呆到学期结束，也不知道能不能带得回几十年后，但总归是有期待“对我们来说，应该轻轻松松吧”"}
{"time": 1773221290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833098161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1638214555]她倒也没进一步的动作，但失血依然在继续，不过你能明显感觉到身下的那具身体逐渐开始有了体温，自己倒是在降温了。"}
{"time": 1773221390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004257340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=707481730]\"哪方面轻轻松松啦...\"妃花有些愁眉苦脸，\"这种东西...我不懂诶...\"\n\"点到名字的同学，请上讲台。\"仿佛是代替希姆，一个水晶球从她的怀里飘出来，悬浮在讲台中央，语气欢欣。"}
{"time": 1773221399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613088662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "失血应该是正常的吧..当时斑比也是很虚弱的样子...哼，到时候等你复活了，一定要好好教训教训你这家伙"}
{"time": 1773221523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061537722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（分院帽开始查成分了）"}
{"time": 1773221805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538138558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你应该也不太能算普通人，比纯人类来说应该好些啦”一个个目送上去领取的人，颇有些跃跃欲试"}
{"time": 1773221897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803948283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"阿拉贡。\"第一个点到名字的似乎是一个黑发的青年，身着华贵，腰间还有配剑，水晶球在他身边环绕了一会，随后阿拉贡当着所有人的面，从球中取出了一把表面刻印着花纹的银剑，\"非常不错。\"希姆教授淡淡地点评。"}
{"time": 1773221923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685760344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎中东人）"}
{"time": 1773221964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974733477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1613088662]随着失血继续，先前剥落的头发重新开始生长，连带着脸上的皮肤也重新恢复弹性，你闻到了她身上的香味，诱惑，但又带着些矜持。"}
{"time": 1773222073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489718692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1538138558]\"唔...\"妃花愁眉苦脸地，\"可是这些理论课好难...\"不过紧接着她就被频空取剑吸引住了，摇了摇你的手臂，\"诶?好神奇。\""}
{"time": 1773222147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000871077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（广义旺财）"}
{"time": 1773222224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485577165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1974733477][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 矜持...没感觉到...只感觉到血仍然在不断的流失，努力保持冷静"}
{"time": 1773222433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854523876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=485577165]索取还在继续，身下的人倒是睁开了眼睛，漂亮的紫红色，像是陈酿多年的红酒。亮紫色的长发卷在你的身上，有些痒酥酥的。"}
{"time": 1773222532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382449149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1489718692]随着念到的名字越来越多，发放出的器具也越来越五花八门，除开最多人拿到的手环之外，剑，戒指，项链，乃至于手套，手袖，镜片，各种东西层出不穷，但无一例外，都出自眼前的教授之手。"}
{"time": 1773222568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196076970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯嗯嗯嗯”点点头，看起来好像是按字母排序？那自己和妃花应该都算得上靠前，不禁开始想象起来自己的收获，会是什么，药罐子吗？"}
{"time": 1773222573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997193232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“够了吧....”有点虚弱，怎么这么贪喝"}
{"time": 1773222622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466364945", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "然后终于，\"妃花。\""}
{"time": 1773222659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426291570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其名为小馋猫）"}
{"time": 1773222660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918136414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "然后终于，\"辛德拉。\"水晶球欢欣的语气喊到了这个名字。"}
{"time": 1773222682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991906823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（艹，我都忘了还有化名环节）"}
{"time": 1773222836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021148381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*立刻起身，快步走到台前，伸手靠近那枚包罗万象的水晶球"}
{"time": 1773222855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215725126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=997193232]她确实松开了嘴，眼睛亮亮地，在雾气中散发着诡魅的红光，\"不要嘛...我好久没喝过这么纯的血了。\"语气里带着娇气。"}
{"time": 1773222956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129915903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这话说的....自己也没喝过什么好血“自我介绍一下，我叫诺薇拉，以后就算是你的主人了，话说你身体其他部位呢...还能找到吗”声音有点抖"}
{"time": 1773223271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949944845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2021148381]水晶球从你的手下躲过，在你的身边旋转，\"有意思。\"你听到了那个欢欣的声音，似乎就在你的耳边开口，\"今年给摩根家的名额已经满了吧，你却有着霞的血脉。\""}
{"time": 1773223355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341444445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2129915903]\"找不到...\"她的语气楚楚可怜，不过紧接着话风一转，\"也没什么关系吧?\"笑嘻嘻地，\"我已经从你身上的血补好了身体哦～\""}
{"time": 1773223522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043243175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你先松开我...”想找个地方坐下休息一会“话说你怎么变成了这样....卡缇娅”"}
{"time": 1773223527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21075348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有立绘吗）"}
{"time": 1773223566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099733995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1043243175]她依然紧紧抱着你，\"再给我一点...还不够...\""}
{"time": 1773223587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978237345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={BE03A9AE-922E-E97A-6292-6EDC34D35696}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-BE03A9AE922EE97A62926EDC34D35696/0,file_size=1511819]"}
{"time": 1773223609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687282550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊啊....”心比较软“好吧好吧...最后一点，再多我就没力气了...”"}
{"time": 1773223654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794391380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=949944845]轻声“啧”了一声，手仍伸在半空“这你也能知道？那不重要吧，摩根家的人也可以不用摩根家的名额”"}
{"time": 1773223901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419463858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=794391380]\"确实呢...\"那语气好像也不以为意，\"你想要什么?执念深重的人，什么才适合你?真有趣。\"水晶球移到你的手边，\"你需要杀人的武器吗？你需要华美的饰品吗？你需要一份...感情?\""}
{"time": 1773223991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509990970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=687282550]身下的身体缠在你身上，脑袋稍微动了动，咬在先前的伤口，失血的脱力感更重了些，额头开始陆续冒出汗珠。"}
