{"time": 1773224086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620550441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然是武器。”毫不犹豫地开口“不然有的人不是很愿意听我说话”"}
