{"time": 1773237084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744577260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=100434296]\"嗯...\"妃花在右手戴上自己的戒指，\"我求了半天，水晶球先生才同意给我。\""}
{"time": 1773237211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195536327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=878009371]\"嗯...\"她倒是没再继续缠着你做什么，割开自己的手腕，血液缠绕着她身体逐渐形成了一套同样紫色的礼服，随后安静地坐在你旁边，贴的很近。"}
{"time": 1773237423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558395154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以，你为什么会变成那样.....你还有印象吗”"}
{"time": 1773237892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711151507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558395154]\"我...\"她神色复杂地看着你，雾气逐渐消散，附近的街景开始变得清晰起来，过了半晌才开口，\"我...我做了对不起她的事...逃跑了...然后...\"她开始发起抖来"}
{"time": 1773238188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437021151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "握住她的手“不要怕...我在”"}
{"time": 1773238269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354257463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...被不认识的人抓住...折磨...\"似乎是提起来就有些崩溃，她的声音染上了哭腔，一抽一抽地开口，\"分成好多好多块...\"说着她把整个人靠在你身上"}
{"time": 1773238722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132881767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了好了...”拍拍她的背“不用再说了”稍微抱一下她"}
{"time": 1773238972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215628829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然不知道你做了什么，不过斑比酱应该也原谅你了...毕竟我也是在她的帮助下，才救了你”"}
{"time": 1773239134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058066878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原谅...真的吗？\"她睁大了些眼睛，看上去楚楚可怜，\"我...我应该不值得被原谅。\""}
{"time": 1773239205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353636069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不敢打包票了...不过没有斑比酱的话...你现在估计还是..”想了想没继续说下去"}
{"time": 1773239926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970579466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1353636069]\"我...我还是什么...?\"她握住你的手，有些用力，\"请告诉我...诺薇拉...主人...\""}
{"time": 1773239985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243026003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没斑比酱的话...你现在可能还是一块一块的...”"}
{"time": 1773240019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74074366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(sv一下，game了)"}
