{"time": 1773298417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868545341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "长舒一口气，打开门“西莉丝姐姐，我认识了一个新朋友，给你介绍一下”"}
{"time": 1773298467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118503572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(幸运大失败我真是，想想)"}
{"time": 1773299230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120917964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1868545341]西里斯换上了平日里的衣裙，头发也已经梳理得很整齐，看上去完全没有昨晚的破碎感，\"新朋友，这一位吗？\"橙红色的眼睛看向卡缇娅。"}
{"time": 1773299253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783797166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={50920133-07EB-B24A-1FF9-A0BA70332BDD}.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-5092013307EBB24A1FF9A0BA70332BDD/0,file_size=52807]"}
{"time": 1773299267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254316538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（生命中有三件必经之事）"}
{"time": 1773299274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268006472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大成功，大失败，还有ti）"}
{"time": 1773299373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368812329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对，她叫卡缇娅，卡缇娅，这位是西莉丝姐姐..我去破坏节点的时候遇到了她，把她带了回来”稍微简略的讲了一下"}
{"time": 1773299571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635284208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(思来想去，该给你一点人生的大起大落了)"}
{"time": 1773299592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117812926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我什么都不会说的）"}
{"time": 1773299664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808262889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2061625096]食堂里此时人满为患，门口进进出出的人流不绝，在门口的时候你不小心和一个女生迎面撞上，\"哎哟...\"对方被你撞得捂着脑袋坐在地板上连连叹气"}
{"time": 1773299776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260963093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "小疼，但问题不大。匕首小心地收在袖子深处，自然没有道歉的打算，皱着眉看看对方是怎么个事"}
{"time": 1773299894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692267411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=F7F138BC372AFB13A704FABEDE70585B.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT_FtMRHlPkhZmBwuc3JTJTmlT8Rhj4swMg_woo4aLw8eiZkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ7W97wXlj3MX1k-k2u945inoCfvmCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMI2xgv5upV6eAPpWl9nwC1kWTK2lKx5_BDWz8m-2qiDBmjOoe27R8fPUo7w-18HG6g,file_size=55800]"}
{"time": 1773299945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902828741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"喂，你这家伙连句道歉都不说的吗？\"她气鼓鼓地瞪着你。"}
{"time": 1773300019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803334333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=368812329]\"嗯...她，应该也是?\"西里斯仔细看了一下才开口。\n反而是卡缇娅先接过了话头，\"西里斯姐姐好!\"声音很甜，\"我是卡缇娅啦....也是血族哦。\""}
{"time": 1773300103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586122657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在旁边点点头"}
{"time": 1773300122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320837623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "突然也就没有解释的意愿了，无语地看着她“我又不是石头，难道不会痛吗？”"}
{"time": 1773300188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234297472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且卡缇娅之前也是贵族哦，应该会和西莉丝姐姐有很多共同话题的”"}
{"time": 1773300859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316885917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1320837623]\"不是你撞倒我的吗？\"对方眉头紧皱，从地上站起来拍拍衣服上的灰尘，头上的两颗团子一抖一抖，整个人像是生气的仓鼠。"}
{"time": 1773301152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887543471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我在往里进，你在往外出。撞在一起了而已。就这么简单”皱着眉瞪回去“这有什么主次之分吗？还是你觉得吃饭算和食物搏斗？”"}
{"time": 1773302950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990714429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(活了)"}
{"time": 1773302956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182008016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(又从岗顶走回来)"}
{"time": 1773303132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152410151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=234297472]\"...\"西里斯稍微思索了一下，虽然她似乎已经接受了血族的身份，吗?\"贵族吗？嗯...我从艾因家出来日久，如今只是普通的骑士团...\"她停住了话，现场一时有些沉默。"}
{"time": 1773303324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483736426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=887543471]\"...\"她摸了摸口袋，突然泄了气，对天翻了个白眼，\"好啦，本大人大人有大量，不和你计较。\"说完她就快速从你身边离开，速度快得像是逃一样。"}
{"time": 1773303380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036380808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总有一种被偷了什么的不踏实感。清点一下身上的随身物品"}
