{"time": 1773303898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721432698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(似乎没有?)"}
{"time": 1773303975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890120361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之好像其实没多少东西）"}
{"time": 1773304024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015070315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1374829097]\"啊哈哈...\"卡缇娅上前凑到西里斯脸上，\"我可是听过艾因家的大名呢，像我这种出身小贵族的女孩...嗯...不过，那也是很久之前的事了，现在已经没有我家了。\"你注意到卡缇娅虽然也有些勉强，但也在尽力缓和气氛。"}
{"time": 1773304192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507479177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2036380808]所有东西似乎都在?但总感觉哪里有点奇怪，直到你刚刚还紧握的匕首在你手中变成了一枚刻着古怪笑脸的金币。"}
{"time": 1773304295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677603425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是赛飞儿）"}
{"time": 1773304567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001398730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2015070315]西里斯倒是先开口结束了这个话题，\"嗯...那些事情都不重要，现在只要能解决当下的事态就好了。\"她的目光看向你，\"所以我也会帮忙的，接下来。\""}
{"time": 1773304604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273790766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐休息好了吗...”大概看一下精神怎么样"}
{"time": 1773305164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929787102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=273790766]看上去很平静，\"嗯...已经可以了。\""}
{"time": 1773305413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291304236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1507479177]“什……什么？”看着手里的硬币愣了一瞬，旋即扭过头去看刚刚那个小鬼跑的方向“怎么可能，我明明放在了最里面”"}
{"time": 1773305574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163488076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..不过我觉得我们得想点周密的计划，节点的防守很厉害，单凭我们可能很难破坏”想到那遮天的蜘蛛网还是有点害怕"}
{"time": 1773305700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952502481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=291304236]跟在你后面的妃花有些没反应过来，跟着你一起看着，\"什么?伊芙，那孩子做了什么?\""}
{"time": 1773305785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485469349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“被偷梁换柱了……”把金币拿给她看“刚拿到的魔导器还没捂热乎……！”"}
{"time": 1773305837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412652867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "脸上自然是压不住的阴沉"}
{"time": 1773306060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035042701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1163488076]\"嗯，我知道。\"她点点头，\"这个时候就该参谋发挥作用了。现在的局势上，我们可以，连结的对象，可以必须讨伐的对象。诺诺，你来回答。\""}
{"time": 1773306246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342134250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“连结的对象，龙芙小姐肯定可以...至于掌控纷争的那个，也可以尝试争取？”"}
{"time": 1773306277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089579686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“必须讨伐的肯定就是蜘蛛了...还有...emmm”思考ing"}
