{"time": 1773308294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891040770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1762697115]\"那么，诺诺带路吧。\"\n\"我跟着lord走...不对，这里有衣服换吗?\""}
{"time": 1773308368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352529780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有吧有吧..大概，西莉丝姐姐有多的衣服吗”"}
{"time": 1773308499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322704501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "其实卡缇娅和你的身材倒是差不多，甚至还要小一点。"}
{"time": 1773308546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351684642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是自己没什么衣服，仅有的一件比较好的还是露露送自己的礼物"}
{"time": 1773308581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693200587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=408505481]\"嗯...丸子头...\"学生皱了皱眉，\"偷窃惯犯，哦，你是在说三年级的云庆学姐吧。\""}
{"time": 1773308607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774420944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找下68号吧“#68 可以帮忙找件衣服吗，适合卡缇娅的”"}
{"time": 1773308940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447931382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还真是惯偷？”撇撇嘴，给对方也看看金币“这东西也是她的吧？她是什么专业的，没人管吗？”"}
{"time": 1773309074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416654411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=774420944]\"客人可以自己在房间的衣柜里翻找，那里的东西酒店的客人有自由使用的权利。\"68号开口回答，声音淡漠。"}
{"time": 1773309120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582181931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就去看看衣柜了，找一件风格和卡提娅身上现在类似的衣服"}
{"time": 1773309316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376440916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好，那你该)"}
