{"time": 1773387954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269063071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你可以回答不知道)"}
{"time": 1773388008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533283133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1749771520]\"唔...\"她听完你的话，蹙眉认真思考了一下，\"也许发生了什么?嗯...\"她下意识摇摇头，\"应该有什么特别的原因吧。\""}
