{"time": 1773416693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117007087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我怎么记得原来有的）"}
{"time": 1773416740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693314945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=393730498]\"...你应该去找希姆教授。\"她歪头看着你，\"...我不是负责魔导器的教授。\""}
{"time": 1773416748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319385426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=117007087](有吗，你翻翻?)"}
{"time": 1773416939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489573646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=319385426]（好的，确实没有）"}
{"time": 1773416970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313579532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，应该是还没修好，我们先回房间吧，整理一下现在的情况”"}
{"time": 1773416995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089171476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"你们一行人回到了房间。"}
{"time": 1773417108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10524707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=693314945]“今天才拿到的就弄丢了，不好开口嘛……”声音小了些"}
{"time": 1773417245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587404340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1089171476]西里斯和卡缇娅分开坐下，给你留下了中间的沙发。"}
{"time": 1773417271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438850676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就坐中间，开始思索"}
{"time": 1773417283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261281184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“到最后好像还是只能靠我们三个”"}
{"time": 1773417330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797954617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是我在想，我们能利用那些规则吗”"}
{"time": 1773417380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028593890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，经济和律法下落不明，暴力也没办法出手...”"}
{"time": 1773417390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604605327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉毫无头绪"}
{"time": 1773417855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383230840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"西里斯接上话，\"现在我们已有的情报，有两个规则才对。\""}
{"time": 1773418180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701229534", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“两个吗”"}
{"time": 1773418206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975401324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不懂啊，规则限制所有人还是只限制一个人）"}
{"time": 1773418237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251653911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“限制所有人的规则...不能绝望之类的”"}
{"time": 1773418249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698779385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是够强大可以无视来着”"}
{"time": 1773418402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156081853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"她思考了一会，\"我觉得，第一个规则应该是...把世界异化的规则，不能绝望...\"她皱眉，\"这真的是规则吗？\""}
{"time": 1773418637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969323209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（大乱斗？）"}
{"time": 1773418639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599026792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"娜哈特提示了我们，艾希连德凛克有自己的规则，这第二个规则，目前我们毫无头绪。\"她橙红色的瞳孔看向你，征求你的看法"}
{"time": 1773418932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979686929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉云璃在雾里看不清，云里雾里了）"}
{"time": 1773419209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461779249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你无敌了)"}
{"time": 1773419220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704254639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你先发表看法)"}
{"time": 1773419252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869498167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么有两个规则来着...我这里不太明白”"}
{"time": 1773419489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041862390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你仔细想想，露露。\"她慢慢开口，\"娜哈特最后的话。\""}
{"time": 1773419591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557974626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐的意思是每个泰坦一个规则，艾希连德凛克的规则不存在，所以我们思考律法和暴力对应的规则就可以了？”"}
{"time": 1773419596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313150616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所谓的规则...和艾希连德凛克的规则，并不是一起说的。\"她皱眉，伸出手，血液从她手心流出，变成了两个悬浮的○"}
{"time": 1773419747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hyw）"}
{"time": 1773419773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136325079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果这两者都是规则的话，现在应该是交融的状态。\"两个圆的一部分链接在一起。"}
{"time": 1773419874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24991381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是艾希连德凛克的规则消失了，所以她的规则也缺少了一部分？”"}
{"time": 1773420073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695153085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=24991381]\"嗯...\"她伸手习惯性地打算摸摸你的脑袋，想了想又收回了手，\"这也是应该思考的一环，她们的规则缺少了一部分...嗯...但我要说的是，整体的规则之下，应该也有他们个人的理...\""}
{"time": 1773420148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877886125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把头稍微凑过去，低一点"}
{"time": 1773420215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823656850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=10524707]\"...\"她沉默了一下，接着才开口，\"按小蛇的意思，我要为了很久以后的事情现在买单?\""}
{"time": 1773420351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678251550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm....”"}
{"time": 1773420363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742952880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=877886125]她伸手摸摸你的脑袋，动作很轻，也很认真，这段时间没说话"}
{"time": 1773420587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362950557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=823656850]“随您的便咯？”见她真的能看得见，忍不住惊讶地抬了抬眉毛“反正我一直是你的后辈，这又不会变。不过……真厉害啊”"}
{"time": 1773420629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77779284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...所以，除开节点之外，规则的扭曲应该也在我们的考虑范围内。\"西里斯收回手开口，\"这一点上，我们要首先考虑...失踪的艾希连德凛克，而现在...我们在的地方。\""}
{"time": 1773420981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946493360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=77779284][CQ:at,qq=1040972910] \"就是曾经我们以为的...\""}
{"time": 1773421004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649342145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(让我想想)"}
{"time": 1773421443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942066426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1946493360][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “以为的....五层？”"}
{"time": 1773421598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212222341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1362950557]\"改变过去可是要付出代价的。\"她摇摇头，从自己的手腕上褪下一条手链，\"你要做好准备，嗯，迟来的拜师礼。\""}
{"time": 1773421796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757921866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1942066426]\"以为这里是艾希连德凛克的驻地啦。\"西里斯笑着摇摇头，\"没想到会是...龙芙小姐在这里。\"她皱起眉。\n一直没说话的卡缇娅这时插进话来，\"那个家伙很可怕...比我强...强得多...\"说着打了个冷颤。"}
{"time": 1773421926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775203816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟龙芙小姐是真龙么...”"}
{"time": 1773421946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451416541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过按龙芙小姐之前说的，这里确实被艾希连德凛克买了来着”"}
{"time": 1773422089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369155632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说他不会已经离开中庭了吧...”"}
{"time": 1773422119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928613955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不...你再回忆一下，诺诺。\"西里斯皱着眉，\"不止于此...\""}
{"time": 1773422466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806039302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不止于此？”"}
{"time": 1773422474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037470335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我怎么什么也想不起来）"}
{"time": 1773422480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221549159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你爬一下记录?)"}
