{"time": 1773468765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210028575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大概主要是看眼睛吧）"}
{"time": 1773469575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1700474123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1877106643]眼前的少女有着一头柔顺飘逸的银白发丝，在光线下流转着光泽，头顶的黑色发箍两侧装饰着紫色宝石，一侧挂着灰色月牙状饰件，耳尖还带有橙黄渐变的飘带。她的眼眸像是澄澈的紫水晶，但却总是蒙着一层雾的样子，身着白色抹胸式紧身衣，搭配黑色颈饰与棕色腰带，手臂处是白色泡泡袖，下身则是白色短裤配同色系裙摆，腿着棕色珠串与白色长靴。"}
{"time": 1773469642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57984371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=912148CF8C4CB175518A321CC1CBAEC7.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTxOSBGnQQF9V4riO69hskqAOqWNhj2ji8g_woo6JOsn-GekwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ9E1uEDfdgKglp3Y3S29jynoCmuaCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMAS3B4wnzxq2JLzzfh4egzB9U707Okru_zEEeSoErz-SeZ17i1XBPaw4ZSpV8YeUqA,file_size=771958]"}
{"time": 1773469964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865698764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1285842667]\"嗯...这件事估计只有问她本人了...可是...\"西里斯看着房间的入口，\"我很难不怀疑。\""}
{"time": 1773470027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012258263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是龙芙小姐现在是肯定是盟友..但是说到底，如果我们单单去破坏节点的话，规则好像也没什么意义？”"}
{"time": 1773470390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088843336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1012258263]\"嗯。\"西里斯皱眉，收回了自己悬浮在空中的血液，\"事实上，破坏节点并不是局中人的看法，对吗\""}
{"time": 1773470473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87106468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......emmm，严格来说，三位泰坦应该算敌人？”"}
