{"time": 1773471710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876488126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=556155829][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “emmm，龙芙小姐感觉应该不是贪图那家伙的权柄才杀他的吧，可能是被冒犯了？”希望如此"}
{"time": 1773471837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1241838298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1486014780]“噢”听起来是自己暂时共情不了的话题“那……你加油。看出来了吧，洋荷老师确实……不太会当老师”"}
{"time": 1773471974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452184999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=876488126]\"不管怎么样，如果是按照娜哈特所言，龙芙小姐甚至可以...杀掉规则的持有者。\""}
{"time": 1773472030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906892271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那说到底，我们直接找龙芙小姐帮忙就万事大吉了”"}
{"time": 1773472192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940829905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1241838298]\"嗯...\"她眨了眨眼睛，眼眸中弥散在水晶中那种不散的雾气看着有些摄人心魄，\"洋荷教授...呃...伊芙同学和她很熟吗？\""}
{"time": 1773472352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970215341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=940829905]“算吗？算吧”点点头“不过她基本一直是那副样子，还说不上了解”"}
{"time": 1773472590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320556965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1906892271]\"嗯...如果她有帮我们的理由的话。或者，说服她?\""}
{"time": 1773472617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809752732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我之前提出破坏节点，龙芙小姐挺支持我的来着”"}
