{"time": 1773475094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259155285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=485433820]\"嗯...不过必要的交涉还是需要的。\"西里斯点点头，\"既然诺诺觉得对方是好人的话，那我们就站在这个视角上考虑好了。\""}
{"time": 1773475638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033705258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1623344784]\"嗯...毕竟伊芙小姐是一年级的新生...\"她皱了皱眉，随后舒展开，\"之前也没有见过的印象...但就是...感觉...气质上...嗯...\""}
{"time": 1773475667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "722146756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1259155285][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “不过现在，好像只能等龙芙小姐找我们了”"}
{"time": 1773475862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33910569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=722146756]卡缇娅拿起放在一边的阳伞，\"既然现在用不到我，那我出个门转转咯?Lord.\""}
{"time": 1773475926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334481294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？...emmm”点点头“那出门注意安全..有什么事的话，你应该可以联系我吧”"}
{"time": 1773476495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19799964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1334481294]\"嗯哼。\"她走到窗边打开窗户一跃而下。"}
{"time": 1773476573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584707827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2033705258]“真的假的，学姐见过的人里还有我这么麻烦的家伙？”单手叉腰"}
{"time": 1773476973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511251550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说我好像是晚上出门，中午才回来吗）"}
{"time": 1773476992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372005772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，我有点困，想休息一会”打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1773477172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305929659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1511251550](✓)"}
{"time": 1773477244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740564105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=584707827]\"倒不是这个意思啦...是说...感觉，很自然地...像是同类?\"艾琳奈有点窘迫，\"对不起...我说了奇怪的话。\"她低下头，你看见她耳尖有点红"}
{"time": 1773477414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651463797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1372005772]\"嗯。\"她点点头，\"诺诺想休息到什么时候?\""}
{"time": 1773477478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841668584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，晚饭时候？或者到诺亚修好了的时候....”伸个懒腰“拜托你了，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1773477574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161952101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1841668584]她点点头，\"回去休息吧，这里我看着。\"西里斯轻轻呼了口气。"}
