{"time": 1773633556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066306468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=851832079]“不太一样嘛，目前为止我是没见过她骂人”耸耸肩“没事的”"}
{"time": 1773634628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598750143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2066306468]\"嗯...\"她点点头，\"谢谢你，伊芙小姐。之后有机会我会去问问的...\"虽然这么说，不过看上去她有些勉强。"}
{"time": 1773635184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479666012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她不说自然也和自己没有关系。确实有点好奇她的血统，但看起来她不知道，自己也没有验证的手段，只得作罢。随后看向妃花“妃花，之后有什么安排吗？”"}
{"time": 1773635212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082978206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=334988364][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 那就在摸一小下好了"}
{"time": 1773635216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012813115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=479666012]\"我吗？嗯...我想继续学一会基础课程。\""}
{"time": 1773635279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346768822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2012813115]“哦，我打算去幻术科那边看看怎么个事”歪了歪头“你要一起去吗？”"}
{"time": 1773635417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949695290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1346768822]\"嗯...如果伊芙想要我一起的话。\"她点点头，马尾一甩一甩"}
{"time": 1773636265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139176298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=949695290]“怎么说呢，有点担心你的东西也被顺走”绕了绕头发“不过去找教授的话，应该不会吧。那走吧”"}
{"time": 1773637536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281647405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1139176298]\"嗯...\"阶梯位于学院的深处，但是，虽然有明确的标示牌指向某个位置，在那附近兜兜转转的你，却始终没看见这个所谓的幻术系建筑"}
{"time": 1773637719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570452301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（sleep）"}
{"time": 1773638323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331381900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2082978206]\"唔...\"睡着的女孩(?)在梦中皱了皱眉，不知是因为你的抚弄还是因为别的什么，发出了一声梦呓"}
{"time": 1773638346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736491569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "收手...别把她弄醒了"}
{"time": 1773638657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937766316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=736491569]大概又过了一会，天色已经完全暗了下来的时候，你发现房间里的油灯不知何时点亮了，西里斯从里面推开门，揉了揉自己的眼睛，看见你们两个的姿势，倒是没有开口说话。"}
{"time": 1773639275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747288359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚上吃什么”小声队西莉斯姐姐说到"}
{"time": 1773639623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525053124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1747288359]\"嗯...\"她走到你旁边坐下，说话的语气很轻，\"以前能用我的血，嗯...不知道现在还可不可以?\""}
{"time": 1773639668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501249867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？我们三互吸吗...这样真的有用吗”挠挠头"}
{"time": 1773640254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448736433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"你这话让她沉默了一下，随后叹了口气，把袖子拉起来，白嫩的手臂伸到你的嘴边，上面完全没有之前受过的伤的痕迹，\"不管怎么样...试试?\""}
{"time": 1773641339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544181248", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐先试试吧...”把也胳膊伸过去"}
{"time": 1773641347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955146889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐先试试吧...”把胳膊也伸过去"}
{"time": 1773641716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110678623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1955146889]\"...\"她的唇动了动，\"我...\"你看得出她很是犹豫和动摇，然而最后还是摇了摇头，\"我还不行...嗯...\""}
{"time": 1773641804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166190438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....没关系的...emmm...如果西莉丝姐姐不想直接吸的话..可以拿个杯子给我吗”"}
{"time": 1773642448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825276919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1166190438]\"还不能确定行不行...\"她避开你的视线，看着自己的腿，一只手攥得紧紧的，\"诺诺先试试...\""}
{"time": 1773642495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890906358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧...”西莉丝姐姐都这样说了，也不好推脱了，那就稍微吸一口看看什么情况"}
