{"time": 1773717008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719866501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2031876010]\"嗯?和我有什么关系呢～\"她伸出手捧起你的脸，\"不会处理的话——我索求，你给予，这样不就好了?\""}
{"time": 1773717018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675350953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=614165517]“你们呢，没什么想说的吗？”有些不适，左右张望着"}
{"time": 1773717130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920352460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1719866501][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “哎？...什么意思...我不懂...我才13岁...”"}
{"time": 1773717230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726743928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=675350953]妃花小声说着许多可能的答案，\"枕头?床?知己?\"路牌都没有做出回应。\n至于泉，早早拄在一边一声不吭，低头玩着自己的手指。"}
{"time": 1773717278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799936078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1920352460]\"比如现在——\"她眯起眼睛，嘴角轻轻勾起，微微露出的眼眸透着荡漾的波纹，\"吻我。\""}
{"time": 1773717324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326081407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....不...在这里吗...不..不好吧..西莉丝姐姐看见了怎么办..”"}
{"time": 1773717391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330385125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（卧槽，你这）"}
