{"time": 1773719158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199304274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...你...这...别...”想要逃跑了"}
{"time": 1773719307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783745119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=520147302]（不了吧）"}
{"time": 1773719378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542198426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1812335239]妃花紧紧跟着你，泉稍微停了一下，才跟上你们的步伐。这通天的阶梯似乎永无尽头，两侧也没有任何栏杆，体感过了十多分钟，伸手已经可以触及云彩。"}
{"time": 1773719421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723761220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1199304274]你的手腕被她紧紧抓着，一直保持着四目相对的状态，\"我才不会，克制自己的欲望。\""}
{"time": 1773719683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769043775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1542198426]“难道说还有第二关？”累的够呛，这时候也不敢往下看了“马纳利亚不是禁空吗”"}
{"time": 1773719780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059797929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1769043775]\"...无尽阶梯...这地方到底是什么鬼啦...\"泉出声吐槽，尽管双腿已经有些哆嗦。\n妃花本来抓着你的袖子，这时突然松了手，\"伊芙，你刚刚说什么?\""}
{"time": 1773719814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628547744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1723761220][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “.....别...别这样...”"}
{"time": 1773719856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648680675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2059797929]“什么？”一下被松开还有点晃“我说马纳利亚禁空啊。总不能这真是第二关”"}
{"time": 1773720292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059208667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=648680675]\"跳下去吧。\"她的眼睛闪烁着光芒，俯身看着已看不清具体的地面。"}
{"time": 1773720400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808059411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1628547744]\"吻我。\"温热的鼻息和话音一同打在你的脸颊，燥热的感觉从互相接触的地方开始蔓延。"}
