{"time": 1773725714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203338750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡)"}
{"time": 1773725724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554697596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我眼睛睁不开了)"}
{"time": 1773744072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100220862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我来问了）"}
{"time": 1773746102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870811558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1683165863]眼睛刚睁开一条缝就重新闭紧了，下意识蜷缩起来"}
{"time": 1773748468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567887109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2100220862](醒了)"}
{"time": 1773748874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058008518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=870811558]预想之中的撞击并没有到来，就像是自然地融入了一片轻柔的云雾中，闭着眼的你自然什么也没看见，但下一刻脚下出现的真实的脚踏大地的触感令人安心。"}
{"time": 1773749166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635186598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=629066303](然后?)"}
{"time": 1773749213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050755906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "擦擦嘴角的血迹....整理一下心情，然后出去"}
{"time": 1773749306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25041178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呼……呼”缓了缓才睁开眼，环顾四周“安、安全……嘛，只有当做马后炮才说得出‘还好’呢……”"}
{"time": 1773749400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103216239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1050755906]客厅里，西里斯正在慢慢喝着高脚杯里的血，卡缇娅则是挂着笑，脸色带着红润，在看着昨天那本书"}
{"time": 1773749441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306258123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么说....走去破坏节点吧？”"}
{"time": 1773749767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94596126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=25041178]你发现自己站在一个大理石的台阶上，但与刚刚不同，这个阶梯是往下延展，每一级的两侧都有房间。头顶是封闭的拱装结构，其上点缀着星空一般的花纹，发出亮光。"}
{"time": 1773750357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262201721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=306258123]\"诺诺这么说的话，那就走吧?\"卡缇娅合上手里的《夜访吸血鬼》，拿起一旁的阳伞站起身，她的唇尤其红润。\n西里斯手里还拿着杯子，\"嗯...\"看上去反应慢了半拍，\"一起去吧，也算有个照应。\""}
{"time": 1773750430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072694030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“里面是不是太大了点，怎么塞下的……”有些惊异，漫无目的地转转“偶尔也不是不能来玩玩”"}
{"time": 1773750989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210144861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2072694030]阶梯一直延展到下面，看上去仿佛无边无际。"}
{"time": 1773751053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486524764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总不能还有第三关……”随便找个房间看看牌子"}
{"time": 1773751394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92291148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=262201721][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 上个节点完全破坏了吗，回忆一下"}
{"time": 1773752167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611315279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1486524764]上面写着正常的名称，有些是教室，有些是办公室，但基本是以一层教室一层办公室排列的。"}
{"time": 1773752273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825936040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然办公室基本会标注着人名。"}
{"time": 1773752288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859264176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=92291148]也许?但是你其实不能确认。"}
{"time": 1773752412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828908680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "实际上也不知道云庆的教授叫什么。找个人问问好了"}
{"time": 1773752441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500110022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们先去我之前去过的那个节点看看吧..那边我不太确定有没有彻底毁掉”"}
{"time": 1773752471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392703257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=859264176]\"之前那个?\"卡缇娅眯了眯眼睛，\"...诺诺难不成是故意的?\""}
{"time": 1773752916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372872961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1828908680]来往的一些学生大多不愿搭理你们，不过一声落地声，泉也走了进来。"}
{"time": 1773752940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497193733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....那应该大概率是成功破坏了吧..换一个去好了”去其他节点位置，记得比较清的"}
{"time": 1773753162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493164208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1372872961]看上去她还有些惊魂未定，身子不停地在抖。"}
{"time": 1773753615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346212650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "只是回头看了一眼就没什么兴趣地跟着妃花接着转悠了。学生找不着就找教授，不过心里已经给幻术科打上最劣的标签了"}
{"time": 1773754077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575495320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1346212650]\"诶...别走...\"她小跑着下楼梯到你身边，伸手拽住了你的袖子，随后又松开，\"都把我带到这里了，不能就这么放下我不管。\""}
{"time": 1773754112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794924979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1497193733](在哪?)"}
{"time": 1773754142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699959038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我不是记了好几个）"}
{"time": 1773754318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086903344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1575495320]“请问这个‘带’是怎么来的？”已经有点懒得翻白眼了“这儿那么多人，自己问去”"}
{"time": 1773754350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923826349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=699959038](我记得我好像给了具体位置，如果没给的话。)"}
{"time": 1773754422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802833068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没给吧）"}
{"time": 1773754432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847171604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我康康）"}
{"time": 1773754481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819569353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你看看)"}
{"time": 1773754624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165763337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1086903344]\"我...\"她欲言又止，反而是脸色涨红，\"不行...你现在带着我...一起。\""}
{"time": 1773754688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246705300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1923826349]（没给）"}
{"time": 1773754807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771266017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……求人的时候总该有点表示吧”已经懒得在她身上浪费表情了，还是看看能不能整点收获好了"}
{"time": 1773755571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656739082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1246705300](好的)"}
{"time": 1773756043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732435647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(休息一下，待会再见喵)"}
{"time": 1773766255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022287880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问）"}
{"time": 1773766498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818451454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以喵)"}
{"time": 1773766511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361904552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还真有啊）"}
{"time": 1773767090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267302489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(稍等几分钟)"}
{"time": 1773767722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885102889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(来了)"}
{"time": 1773767788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473682256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1497193733]附近离你比较近的节点，广场附近确实倒是有一个。"}
{"time": 1773767813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010926691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就去那里了，带路"}
{"time": 1773767873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193160844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "晚间的广场不乏一些散步的居民，虽然看上去多少笼罩着些病态，但相较前几日街上死气沉沉的样子着实好了不少。"}
{"time": 1773767897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545713717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你在前面带路，最后停在了广场旁一个普普通通的凉亭前。"}
{"time": 1773767920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027865667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么这么多人...是不是该再晚点来的”想到之前那个很大的动静"}
{"time": 1773768160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842695848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"卡缇娅倒是满不在乎，走进凉亭里坐下，\"需要在乎这些普通人吗？\""}
{"time": 1773768255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856608465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....不要说这种本末倒置的话...”摇了摇头“如果只是想离开，我之前就走了...但我还想救其他人，才选择了留下来”"}
{"time": 1773768421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31054812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她摊摊手，算是没有反驳你的话，\"那我们怎么做?在这里等着?\""}
{"time": 1773768442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177557679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，好像只能这样了”"}
{"time": 1773768466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130018535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐有什么好办法吗”"}
{"time": 1773768566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...哈?\"卡缇娅的语气有些不满。\n\"最好先摸清楚这里的节点是怎么样的状态。\"西里斯看了看凉亭，\"没有蛛丝的话，我们顺不到有用的线索。\""}
{"time": 1773768828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750213675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "突然想起了不好的回忆“上次来这附近...地下忽然出现了好多蛛丝..希望这次不会出事”"}
{"time": 1773768874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100913264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尝试感受一下，周围有没有类似上次的那种血腥气"}
{"time": 1773768951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604007025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "并没有，一切都很安详，就像是一如曾经那般平静的夜晚。"}
{"time": 1773768966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324790371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抛开街道上有些病殃殃的人群之外。"}
{"time": 1773769002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344378118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说西莉丝姐姐，广场地下有什么空间吗”"}
{"time": 1773769223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492535099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1344378118]\"嗯...\"她思考了一下，最后摇了摇头，\"这件事如果想要知道的话，得问建城者们才行。\"她指着街边的一家咖啡厅，\"我们先去坐坐吧。\""}
{"time": 1773769233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408945865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(广场这个咖啡厅也是老生常谈了)"}
{"time": 1773769241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061314980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我印象里来了好多次这里)"}
{"time": 1773769285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659160381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm。。。也好，我没意见，过去也能打听打听”"}
{"time": 1773769446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378951454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你们一同走进了这家咖啡厅，晚上并没有几个客人，所以看上去很是冷清。"}
{"time": 1773769455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800655801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"点点什么?\"菜单递到你手上"}
{"time": 1773769498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064242918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“卡缇娅喝什么..我自己几乎不怎么喝咖啡啦，和西莉丝姐姐一样就行”"}
{"time": 1773769661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146258542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我的话?\"她看了眼菜单"}
