{"time": 1773769763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202969910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（懒得喷）"}
{"time": 1773769777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195040726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正我喝和西莉丝姐姐一样的”"}
{"time": 1773769810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682437552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...这个吧。\"她指了一款看上去很粉粉嫩嫩的饮料，叫樱花特调。西里斯倒是只是简简单单点了一杯热可可。"}
{"time": 1773770059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569621855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "稍等了片刻，三杯饮品端上了桌，黄色的氛围灯点缀在店里，显得夜景也有些摇曳。"}
{"time": 1773770122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057293806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "问下服务员“我听别人说广场下面是空的..真的假的啊”"}
{"time": 1773770279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578448179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"广场下面怎么会是空的?\"服务员对这个问题表示奇怪，\"如果是空的话，早就掉下去了吧？\""}
{"time": 1773770329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18416697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能是什么支架之类的撑着么，或者一小块空着的，我也只是听说么”"}
{"time": 1773770467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912135157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了）"}
{"time": 1773770535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466185399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(嗯。)"}
