{"time": 1773897665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081925840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个女孩穿着连袖的类旗袍装扮，白色长发扎成了双马尾，发梢被不知材质的素绳扎住，尖尖的耳朵带着漆黑鹿角，一只手带着半环，另一只手拿着不长不短的镶嵌着紫色发光宝石的手杖。一只紫色泛着妖艳虹光的蛇从她的腿一路缠到肩膀，然后周围还有好多羊”"}
{"time": 1773897826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111056797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1081925840]\"有些没印象...\"尽管你的描述已经足够具体，但显然面前的两人知之甚少，\"幻境，鹿，蛇?\"最后摇了摇头，\"和前面一个比起来，这才像是在做梦吧。\""}
{"time": 1773898034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424652284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个是真的，露露可以....”说到这顿时停了下来...露露已经不在了啊...久久的沉默"}
{"time": 1773898158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771247680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"ver\":\"1.0.0.19\"&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;QQ小程序&#93;重新认识一下吧\"&#44;\"config\":{\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":0&#44;\"height\":0&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"autoSize\":0&#44;\"ctime\":1773898152&#44;\"token\":\"888ad0aa25a25a203894e4db28091a7f\"}&#44;\"needShareCallBack\":false&#44;\"app\":\"com.tencent.miniapp_01\"&#44;\"view\":\"view_8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail_1\":{\"appid\":\"1109937557\"&#44;\"appType\":0&#44;\"title\":\"哔哩哔哩\"&#44;\"desc\":\"重新认识一下吧\"&#44;\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/open.gtimg.cn\\/open\\/app_icon\\/00\\/95\\/17\\/76\\/100951776_100_m.png?t=1773819955\"&#44;\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/qq.ugcimg.cn\\/v1\\/94ne5de285od49mkbqg0b2thmhcn1qog4fo2ql3a9dhbmj7ejeg6v48j6amb91uesnj6u2rl5pvdru8p9n1eit18d1413ji5it5clfqbde1ibl272gou0hffcmbao006ddgut9rgpkosp95lammli0rfbo\\/e9vf2tsqr6j29hl2kodb3vahlc\"&#44;\"url\":\"m.q.qq.com\\/a\\/s\\/9a397fad433cf0b4ece3eb31500d39da\"&#44;\"scene\":1036&#44;\"host\":{\"uin\":1040972910&#44;\"nick\":\"划船不靠桨の233\"}&#44;\"shareTemplateId\":\"8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"shareTemplateData\":{}&#44;\"qqdocurl\":\"https:\\/\\/b23.tv\\/yo835I0?share_medium=android&amp;share_source=qq&amp;bbid=XY987989FE130EACC8C8E16FA6F7F7D8D9EB3&amp;ts=1773898151571\"&#44;\"showLittleTail\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePoints\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePointsUrl\":\"\"&#44;\"shareOrigin\":0}}}]"}
{"time": 1773898180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748237673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1424652284]\"当务之急是从这里脱离出去。\"沉默了一会，西里斯才接上话，\"一切还没有尘埃落定，记得我说的，对吗？\""}
{"time": 1773898372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300085529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...西莉丝姐姐说的对”努力去打起精神“在之后的话...我和师父去了一个镇子上...”"}
{"time": 1773898597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222138388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“白天和露露一起买衣服，遇到了一个精灵和一个看起来是人类的的人，一个叫卡诗戴尔，一个叫桃乐丝，但不知为什么两个人都会魔法，而且看起来沉稳的卡诗戴尔姐姐反而是徒弟呢，然后晚上我一个人瞎溜达，第一次遇到了里榭娜姐姐，听她唱了会歌，在之后起了大雾，我还听到了打斗声就逃跑了...”"}
{"time": 1773898599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142870393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是朝花夕拾环节。)"}
{"time": 1773898673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827028940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后之后我们还和那两位姐姐同行了一段时间，再之后就到马里亚纳了，但在这之后..我的脑子就晕晕的，不太能讲清楚之后的事了”"}
{"time": 1773899367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168846319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是...\"西里斯摇了摇头，\"对我而言，这段经历也算得上是一段冒险的中途了。\""}
{"time": 1773899396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393818726", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"重复的离别与邂逅，诺诺觉得开心吗？或者...悲伤呢故事\""}
{"time": 1773899402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893935056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"重复的离别与邂逅，诺诺觉得开心吗？或者...悲伤呢?\""}
{"time": 1773899786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828192437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......我只是想和大家一直在一起...”"}
{"time": 1773900005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075813282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"西里斯率先站起身，\"这个故事要有一个彩色的句号，不然怎么对得起这一路的颠沛流离。\"她看向窗外的亭子，\"时间不早了，去看看吧。\"\n卡缇娅伸了个懒腰，\"确实要活动一下了。\""}
{"time": 1773900356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261803284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？怎么这样。你们还没讲呢...”不过也只是说说，也站了起来，准备离开"}
{"time": 1773900495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378398983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"都说了，故事很长，要找个合适的时间，慢慢讲才行。\"卡缇娅推开门。"}
{"time": 1773900740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665876409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧...很期待你的故事呢”跟在卡提娅身后"}
{"time": 1773901078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278904418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你们重又回到了凉亭边，此刻天色已晚，街道上已经没什么人了。"}
{"time": 1773901444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245130513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“开挖吗？”"}
{"time": 1773901463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71652827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"试试看?\"卡缇娅对你眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1773902377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957525802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那事已至此，只能挖了，放血，控制血液成螺旋状，向下挖掘"}
{"time": 1773902670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442699805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么感觉这么方便呢，这能力)"}
{"time": 1773902673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120453095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我想想)"}
{"time": 1773902799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903338696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1957525802]马纳利亚的地面是坚实的石板，要用血液挖掘，总是差了点感觉。"}
{"time": 1773902804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218298916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是很方便啊（））"}
