{"time": 1773902827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357136886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1903338696]（怎么感觉你在找事（）"}
{"time": 1773902899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138110201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“卡提娅那就先把地板锤开吧，有点硬”"}
{"time": 1773903010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335920540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=323120101]打量着那枚光彩夺目的羽毛，抬了抬眉毛，暂时没有伸手去拿“你确实是老好人，不过可以的话我还是比较想收她的赔礼”看了看云庆"}
